{
  "slug": "ctx",
  "name": "Ctx",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A context layer for multi-repo workspaces. Maps features across repositories with product definitions, engineering contracts, and implementation docs — designed for AI-assisted development.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills** and **3 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `add-feature` (Design and implement a new feature from scratch — product definition, engineering design, implementation, and validation), `add-index` (Scan workspace repos and generate _ctx/index.md — a comprehensive big-picture map of the entire project including domain glossary,…), `add-use-case` (Implement a new use case for an existing feature, maintaining consistency with product definitions and engineering contracts), `export` (Scan workspace repos and export _ctx/config.json with repo list and context link), `init` (Initialize a ctx workspace — name the project, explore all repos, and generate a workspace map), `map-engineering` (Build the engineering.md for a feature by exploring the codebase to extract the key interfaces, constraints, and patterns), `map-implementation` (Explore all repos in the workspace to build the implementation.md for a feature, mapping its current state end-to-end), `map-product` (Build the product.md for a feature by exploring the codebase and talking to the developer to define use…), and 4 more\n- **Agents** (3): `contract-reviewer` (Validates that a feature's code and implementation are consistent with its product and engineering contracts), `feature-implementer` (Implements code changes for a feature given its full context and a task description), `feature-modifier` (Modifies an existing feature's code given a change description and the feature's full context (product, engineering, implementation))\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ctx@claude-community` from `nicolasse/ctx`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 12,
    "agent": 3
  },
